Suggests: bsdextrautils, file, fzf, man-db, tealdeer, util-linux, whiptail
Description: interactive Bash command lookup utility
 Two Bash utilities for looking up Linux commands and their reference material.
 le-bash provides a prompt-driven inspector for binary details, man pages,
 tldr pages, command help, and cheat.sh. linux-explorer provides an interactive
 command lookup menu with search and shortcuts to man, tldr, and cht.sh.
